{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_84","type":"agent_message","text":"**Changes Made**\n\n- Added `@hiero-ledger/sdk@2.91.0` as the current Hedera SDK dependency.  \n- Created `src/transfer.ts` that:\n  - Loads environment variables via `dotenv`.\n  - Builds a `TransactionId` using `VALID_START`.\n  - Constructs a `TransferTransaction` transferring 1 hbar from the operator to the recipient, with memo `invoice 42` and node `0.0.3`.\n  - Signs the transaction with the operator’s DER‑encoded ED25519 private key.\n  - Prints the signed transaction bytes as a hex string.\n  - Operates entirely offline (no network submission).  \n- Verified TypeScript compilation with `npx tsc --noEmit` (no errors).  \n- Documented the work and instructions in `ANSWER.md`."}}
